    "scoring": "P/R/F1 on the hidden test slice of each pair, with train/valid reference pairs removed from the predictions and every submitted correspondence counted whatever its relation. Standard: plain set P/R/F1 against the standard reference. Repaired (headline): coherence-aware, so a prediction that matches a '?' pair of the repaired reference is neither a true nor a false positive. Macro = the unweighted mean of the three per-pair values. Computed by the organisers with the unmodified CodaBench scoring program, which reproduces the public CodaBench leaderboard exactly for every system on it.",
